# 4tomorrow styling

Before designing or changing any client UI (layout, components, colour, type, spacing, or Bootstrap markup), read `client/docs/4tomorrow_style_guide_v2.md` and follow it.

- Use the guide’s semantic tokens, type scale, spacing, and component rules. Do not invent colours, font sizes, or spacing.
- Implement the guide with Bootstrap 5 utilities and components, plus small overrides in `client/src/app/globals.css` when Bootstrap has no matching utility.
- This applies to the Next.js client only. Do not apply it to Catalyst functions.
